  Equation (8) needs source reconciliation before its sharper forward bound is
  adopted: the displayed two-argument h has no definition. The looser forward
  condition in Bounds.clean follows the g(n,n) conclusion of Theorem 1.
  The sparse bound must count support and connect skipped zeros to the floating
